      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "4ca89288-3cd1-423a-aea4-9a091fbd0461",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotels in Leipzig \u0026amp; Weimar\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETwo dinners included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Germany\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Germany\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "248ce023-766a-47df-85a1-5cefe4ea873f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThree nights at the 4* Westin Hotel, just a short walk from Leipzig City Centre\u2019s Opera House, M\u00E4dlerpassage and St Thomas Church, and three nights at the 4* Leonardo Hotel in Weimar, located a fifteen to twenty minute walk or short bus ride from the Old Town. Facilities at both hotels include a restaurant, bar and indoor swimming pool and all rooms are en suite. Dinner is included on the first night at each hotel and the remaining four nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "e38d3253-962f-4a10-a68b-3ca6b340cecf",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELutherstadt Wittenberg\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeipzig\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseum der Bildenden K\u00FCnste\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBauhaus Dessau\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EW\u00F6rlitzer Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWeimar - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGoethe House \u0026amp; Goethes Gartenhaus\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEisenach \u0026amp; Wartburg Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EErfurt - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBauhaus Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "f7b31c3e-976d-445b-9205-69a41e5ed255",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "cc60de7e-0f6f-415f-8dfe-0771950f3643",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Lutherstadt Wittenberg\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Germany from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager and private executive coach to Lutherstadt Wittenberg for time at leisure to explore the capital of the Reformation whose sights include the Castle and the Schlosskirche, made famous by Martin Luther who allegedly posted his theses on its door in 1517 \u2013 continue to the 4* Westin Hotel in Leipzig \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Leipzig \u0026amp; Museum der Bildenden K\u00FCnste\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour of Leipzig takes in sights such as the Opera House and the Church of St Nicholas \u2013 a guided tour of the Museum der Bildenden K\u00FCnste in Leipzig introduces a fine collection of paintings by German masters including Lucas Cranach, Elder, Martin Schongauer and Caspar David Friedrich.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Bauhaus Dessau \u0026amp; W\u00F6rlitzer Park\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn Dessau, once the capital of the duchy of Anhalt-Dessau, we enjoy a guided tour at the Bauhaus Dessau complex, built in 1925 to a design by Walter Gropius and the home of the famous art school that moved here from Weimar \u2013 W\u00F6rlitzer Park, an English style landscaped garden that was the first of its kind in continental Europe, was laid out between 1765 and 1817 and was inspired by Prince Franz Anhalt-Dessau\u2019s visit to Claremont, Stourhead and Stowe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Guided tour of Weimar, Goethe House \u0026amp; Goethes Gartenhaus\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour of Weimar introduces us to a town associated with classical poets such as Goethe and Schiller, the musicians Bach and Liszt and the Bauhaus pioneers van de Velde and Gropius \u2013 during our tour we visit Goethe House, the house that was home to the poet from 1782 to 1789 as a tenant and then from 1792 to 1832 as the owner, and Goethes Gartenhaus, the small villa that was his first home in Weimar and later his summer house \u2013 check in to the 4* Leonardo Hotel in Weimar \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Eisenach \u0026amp; Wartburg Castle\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning at leisure in Eisenach \u2013 the UNESCO listed Wartburg Castle, built according to legend by Ludwig dem Springer in 1067, was home to St Elisabeth, where Martin Luther translated the New Testament and where Richard Wagner was inspired to write his opera \u2018Tannh\u00E4user\u2019.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Guided tour of Erfurt\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided walking tour of the old quarter of Erfurt, Martin Luther\u2019s spiritual home, takes in the Merchant\u2019s Bridge, the Town Hall, the university where Luther studied the \u2018seven liberal arts\u2019 between 1501 and 1505, the late Gothic Cathedral of St Mary, whose central Tower is home to the \u2018Gloriosa\u2019, the world\u2019s largest medieval free swinging bell, and the Old Synagogue, constructed during the Middle Ages on the \u2018Via Regia\u2019, one of the major European trade routes \u2013 afternoon at leisure in Erfurt and you may choose to explore Petersburg Citadel, the only extensively preserved Baroque town fortress in central Europe, or the Augustinerkloster, an early Gothic church built for Augustinian monks at the end of the 13th century.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Bauhaus Museum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisit the Bauhaus Museum in Weimar, offering an insight into the development of the State Bauhaus art school \u2013 transfer to the airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
